    "referrals": [
      "POL-RD-09(4) billing-integrity review: an airport surcharge of SGD 6.00 was applied to trip TRP-00803, which originated at Bugis Victoria Street and ended at Suntec City and therefore did not originate at Changi or Seletar Airport; the line is refunded in full and the fare breakdown should be corrected."
