    {
      "claim": "Disclosure: the traffic advisory for this trip, EV-ADVIS-00803-01, is MISSING - it has no payload and an admissibility weight_multiplier of 0.0. Its absence is itself citable. Because no advisory record covers this trip window, POL-RD-03 cannot be run at all: the comparison of road, validity window and corridor leave-and-rejoin has nothing to compare against, and any external traffic cause would carry no weight under POL-RD-08. Nothing on this record therefore reduces the excess or supplies an amended optimal route.",
